  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GAL 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ini Paulo, mdumi usedumilo ni wandu, hata kudumwa kwa chia ya mdamu, ela kwa chia ya Jesu Kristo, na Mlungu Aba uo oremrukishireghe kufuma kwa wafu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ini chiaimweri na wanidu wose dikwanye aha, namuandikia inyo makanisa ghose gha Galatia:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mvono ndeghukaie konyu, na sere ifumagha kwa Mlungu Aba, na Bwana odu Jesu Kristo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uo orekufunyireghe moni kwa wundu ghwa kaung'a redu, upate kudikira na ngelo rizamie ra matuku agha, karakara na lukundo lwa Mlungu Aba odu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwake uo ndeghukaie wubaa kwa kala na kala. Amen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilagho jija jeni Jiboie",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nashinika angu mwaghaluka shwa-shwa, na kumsigha uo oremmbangieghe andenyi ya mvono ghwa Kristo, na kujighalukia ilagho jiboie izima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si angu wei jeko ilagho jiboie jingi izima, ela weko wandu wamu wawuyamjisha wasi na kukunda kujighalua Ilagho Jiboie ja Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela hata ngera isi, angu malaika ufumagha mlungunyi, wamchilia ilagho jiboie izima jisefwananagha na ijo jeni deremchilieghe, ndewado ni njowe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sa iji koni dereghorieghe imbiri, na idana naghora sena, ikakaia mndungi wawuyamchilia ilagho jiboie izima jisefwananagha na ijo jeni deremchilieghe, ndewado ni njowe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele naawuyakunda kukaswa ni wandu, angu ni Mlungu? Anguu, huwu naawuyatima kuwiboia wandu? Ngera nadadua ngiwiboia wandu, kumangu seredimagha kukaia mdumiki wa Kristo anduangi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Seji Paulo ocheewuya mdumi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakundeghe mmanye huwu wanidu, kukaia, ijo Ilagho Jiboie nerejichilieghe, ndejerekoghe ja mdamu anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu ini serejiwusireghe kufuma kwa mdamu, hata serejifundishiroghe, ela jedeecha kwa chia ya mafunuo gha Jesu Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu mwasikire malagho gha irangi japo ja imbiri andenyi ya dini ya Kiyahudi, seji nerejikorongieghe ikanisa ja Mlungu na ndighi, na kutima kujinona;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.8.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mab. 8.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.22.4+ACT.22.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22.4-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.26.9+ACT.26.10+ACT.26.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26.9-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nani nerewichumbieghe wandu wengi wa irika japo jeni, kwa maza ra dini ya Kiyahudi aghadi ya wandu wapo; ngafunga ndighi loli-loli kuiwadia mizango ya weke aba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.22.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mab. 22.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Mlungu, uo orenisaghueghe imbiri nisevalo, na kuniwanga kwa mvono ghwake,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.9.3+ACT.9.4+ACT.9.5+ACT.9.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mab. 9.3-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.22.6+ACT.22.7+ACT.22.8+ACT.22.9+ACT.22.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22.6-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.26.13+ACT.26.14+ACT.26.15+ACT.26.16+ACT.26.17+ACT.26.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26.13-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uendaboilwa umfunukuo Mwana wake andenyi kwapo, eri niwonemchila aghadi ya iro mbari zima, serebonyereghe njama na mndungi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hata serejokieghe Jerusalemu kwa awo werezoeghe kukaia wadumi imbiri yapo anduangi; ela nereghendieghe noko cha Arabu, ima ngawuya Dameshki sena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko nyuma ya miaka idadu ngajoka Jerusalemu kumroghua Kefa, ngakaianya nao matuku ikumi na masanu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.9.26+ACT.9.27+ACT.9.28+ACT.9.29+ACT.9.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mab. 9.26-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nani seremmbonieghe mdumi ungi mzima, ela Jakobo moni, mruna Bwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na agha malagho nimwandikiagha, niamghoria loli imbiri ya Mlungu, siwueghora tee anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konyuma nereghendieghe masanga gha Siria na Kilikia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelo iro, wandu wa makanisa gha Kristo ghiko Judea ndewerekoghe waniwona; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela wedesikira malagho ghikighorwa wei, “Uo orekoghe ukidikoronga imbiri, idanaha waawuyajichila ijo irumirio oretimieghe kujinona ko imbiri.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
